180	     * {@code registrationDate} and the current date. Returns {@code 0} when no registration date is
181	     * present, so an owner without a registration date has no tenure.
182	     *
183	     * @param owner the owner being mapped
184	     * @return the owner's tenure in whole days, or {@code 0} when no registration date is present
185	     */
